{"exportedAt":"2026-07-27T12:49:57.719Z","goal":{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a675372ba63bbdf0c9d5e48","startDate":1785110400000,"endDate":1794700800000,"durationInWeeks":16,"competitionDate":1794700800000,"goalType":"marathon","break":"long","paid":true,"stats":{"trainingsCount":119,"trainingsDoneCount":0,"distanceTotal":0,"timeTotal":0},"status":"ongoing","isEditable":true,"sessionCompetitionInfo":{"sessionCompetition":{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"MARATHON","description":"Aujourd'hui, la clé sera la maîtrise. Les premiers kilomètres doivent presque te sembler trop faciles. Résiste à l'envie d'accélérer et respecte ton allure cible dès le départ. Pense à t'hydrater et à t'alimenter régulièrement, même si tu ne ressens pas encore le besoin. Le marathon commence réellement lorsque la fatigue s'installe, et chaque effort économisé au début sera précieux à la fin. Tu as investi des mois de travail pour arriver jusqu'ici. Fais confiance à ta préparation, reste patient(e) et profite de cette journée unique. Bonne course ! 🏅🏃‍♂️🏃‍♀️","displayName":"MARATHON","coachAdvice":"L'équipe CAMPUS te souhaite bon courage pour ta compétition ! On est tous derrière toi :)","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"Competition","trainingCategory":"road_competition","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"course","value":285,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"race"},"durations":[{"value":12026,"timeUnit":"seconds"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":5,"trainingIndex":3,"weekDate":1794182400000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a6753f2ba63bbdf0c9d6dcd","userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","weekDate":1794182400000,"sessionIndex":3,"choRecommendation":5,"formSuggestions":["liquid","semi-liquid"],"recipeOptions":{"1":{"homemade":[],"commercial":[]},"2":{"homemade":[[{"datoId":"AdSspNUrTa-cUILb7xt-4g","name":"Compote de pommes","for