en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Qu'en est-il de l'amélioration de tes capacités cardio-respiratoires ? Tu devrais vraiment être très à l'aise à ton allure de footing arrivé(e) à ce stade de ta préparation ! Lorsqu'on est en forme, les footings, ce sont des entraînements où on a presque l'impression d'être aussi frais en revenant qu'avant d'être parti ! (et si tu es parti déjà fatigué(e) à cause de l'entraînement fractionné de la veille par exemple... alors tu ne devrais pas être plus fatigué(e) encore en rentrant sinon mieux vaut raccourcir le footing avant de rentrer dans cet état d'accumulation de fatigue supplémentaire!)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":329,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":6,"weekDate":1786320000000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.104651162790698,"expectedDuration":2100},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2100,"pace":{"value":329}}]}],"weekStats":{"expectedDistance":32.15894987347873,"realDistance":0,"expectedDuration":11100,"realDuration":0},"exportStatus":"NotAvailable","goalDuration":{"durationInWeeks":16,"index":3},"coach":{"name":"Tristan","image":"https://www.datocms-assets.com/89756/1765362553-tristan-tete.png"},"access":"allowed"},{"userId":"642ab60364e5867bee895c04","_id":"6a6753efba18ec46052277db","articles":["DrR-I6_nStWjdMo17BlCHw","JQqpHs_NR_SmcUdR84cnjQ","SWevuE6iTi2vgO20wzYRWw","fXsuskqsRJKyUegAH67w7g","GssCR6PsTvu-36aGA22sVQ"],"weekDate":1786924800000,"context":{"priority":"performance","backgroundGoal":"speed","goalId":"6a675372ba63bbdf0c9d5e48","cycleTheme":"S60","cycleDescription":"En fonction de ton profil et du temps jusqu'à l'objectif, ce cycle S60 sur-mesure commence 3-4 mois avant ton marathon. L'objectif est simple : catapulter ton niveau jusqu'à l'affutage. Un cycle qui repoussera tes limites avec des intervalles longs, mais qui te mettra vraiment en confiance. Tout ce que tu as réalisé avant ce cycle prendra son sens ici, c'est ici qu'on aligne toutes les planètes.","isStatic":false},"estimatedPaces":[{"slug":"slow","value":598.6976076896065,"dvalue":40,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"moderate","value":254.75731815112857,"dvalue":11.608566551956223,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"fast","value":192.05763027578735,"dvalue":5.69752462249924,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sprint","value":153.77088061779978,"dvalue":3.254880624932233,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"ef","value":327.9087093682076,"dvalue":20.10199868447083,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"tempo","value":299.8795797293558,"dvalue":16.687645453135573,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sweet-spot","value":268.20567442992245,"dvalue":13.062952909132688,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"aerobie","value":318.18824619423356,"dvalue":18.897494474129754,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil60","value":254.75731815112857,"dvalue":11.608566551956223,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil30","value":241.9832887186469,"dvalue":10.279530782104944,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vma","value":211.85268307189702,"dvalue":7.379435540905239,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"marathon","value":289.241654757931,"dvalue":14.25898327580912,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"half-marathon","value":263.0752150422888,"dvalue":12.501740855046302,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"10km","value":247.79224338526402,"dvalue":10.877273