ear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_40","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Cette fois, c'est sûr, le footing ça doit définitivement être devenu ta sortie la plus agréable ! Avec la forme qui monte tu dois te sentir pousser des ailes lors de tes footings non ? Si c'est le cas... retiens-toi, garde cette allure lente où tu es en total contrôle, on est pile dans la bonne zone de travail !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_40","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":40,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":6.997084548104956,"expectedDuration":2400},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2400,"pace":{"value":328}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S30_600_1","description":"Séance pour commencer à prendre tes marques sur le seuil 30' où tu vas enchaîner **8 répétitions de 1'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 1' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 30","coachAdvice":"On commence par prendre ses marques avec cette vitesse qui à la fois est inconfortable et à la fois peut être maintenue relativement longtemps (30 minutes sur le papier). Profite bien de ce nouveau cycle d'entraînement, moins tu manqueras de séances de seuil, plus tu pourras profiter des bénéfices exceptionnels de ce cycle !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":8,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_1","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_1","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":599,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":1,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":328,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1786924800000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":8.032620044724325,"expectedDuration":2760},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":328}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":60,"pace":{"value":599}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":60,"pace