on":60},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":0},{"kind":"GPP","duration":120}],"gear":["weights"],"duration":{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_45","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de ta forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"Comment minimiser ta progression ? À cause de footings courus trop rapidement et qui génèrent une fatigue qui va s'ajouter à celle des entraînements fractionnés ! Le programme qu'on te donne a été étudié pour que ces séances soient courues à allure lente, sinon la charge d'entraînement va être trop forte et tu vas soit te blesser, soit t'entraîner plus fort que ce que ton corps peut accepter... et donc ne pas progresser !","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_45","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":45,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":4,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":7.894736842105263,"expectedDuration":2700},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":2700,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"S30_600_4","description":"Séance de seuil 30' où tu vas enchaîner **4 répétitions de 3'** à l'allure cible entrecoupées de 2' de footing lent pour récupérer.","displayName":"Seuil 30","coachAdvice":"On commence à aborder les choses sérieuses. Reste concentré(e) pendant tes intervalles d'allures. Attention à ta posture, à ton gainage et à ton souffle afin de rester efficace. Avec la fatigue, tu vas vouloir te relâcher : grosse erreur.","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"Intensity","trainingCategory":"road_intensity","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU_20","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":20,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":4,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"S30_3","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Seuil 30","value":242,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z4","abstract":false,"slug":"seuil30"},"durations":[{"value":3,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false},{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Recup_2","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"Lent","value":597,"kind":"abstract","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":true,"slug":"slow"},"durations":[{"value":2,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":4,"trainingIndex":5,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","stats":{"_t":"SessionExpectedStats","expectedDistance":9.042384606809602,"expectedDuration":3000},"paceZones":[{"kind":"Z2","duration":1200,"pace":{"value":327}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"Z4","duration":180,"pace":{"value":242}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":120,"pace":{"value":597}},{"kind":"RECOVER","duration":600,"pace":{"value":327}}]},{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"SL_100_HARD_1","description":"Sortie longue en endurance fondamentale avec un bloc actif **FACULTATIF** en deuxième moitié de sortie (en cas de fatigue excessive, douleur, manque d'envie...). Le bloc actif est composé de 30' Tempo en continu.","displayName":"Sortie Longue & Active","coachAdvice":"Toujours en fin de semaine afin de travailler avec un corps \"fatigué\" par les séances précédentes, la sortie longue vise seulement à te habituer à enchaîner de longs kilomètres, malgré la fatigue ! Ainsi, le jour J, reposé, tu verras que ça passera beaucoup plus facilement ! (au moins jusqu'au 30ème km ! :))","test":false,"importance":true,"trainingType":"SL","trainingCategory":"road_long_run","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"WU 60'","exerciseType":"warm-up","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":60,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"warm-up"},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"Tempo_30","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"Tempo","value":299,"kind":"single-value","zoneKind":"Z3","abstract":false,"slug":"tempo"},"durations":[{"value":30,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]},{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"CD_10","exerciseType":"recuperation","pace":{"name":"EF","value":327,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"RECOVER","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":10,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":true}],"blockType":"cool-down"}],"difficulty":3,"trainingIndex":6,"weekDate":1788739200000,"status":"todo","nutritionTraining":{"_id":"6a6753f2ba63bbdf0c9d6dbb","userId":"642ab6