'effort de ton objectif. Ton plus gros volume hebdomadaire du bloc sera quant à lui atteint 3 semaines avant la course, avec ta séance test sur la sortie longue, pour se laisser le temps d'effacer la fatigue PROGRESSIVEMENT jusqu'à la course (oui, on ne coupe pas tout du jour au lendemain. Tu vas avoir des séances intenses jusqu'à l'avant-dernière semaine).","isStatic":true},"estimatedPaces":[{"slug":"slow","value":590.9890573431576,"dvalue":40,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"moderate","value":251.47718208933134,"dvalue":11.459100079121647,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"fast","value":189.58478606631414,"dvalue":5.624165960566117,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sprint","value":151.79099868769734,"dvalue":3.2129723045268817,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"ef","value":323.68671021080576,"dvalue":19.8431747524336,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"tempo","value":296.01847053412035,"dvalue":16.47278313618794,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"sweet-spot","value":264.7523836233583,"dvalue":12.894760437875055,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"aerobie","value":314.0914031737612,"dvalue":18.65417917487921,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil60","value":251.47718208933134,"dvalue":11.459100079121647,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"seuil30","value":238.86762508457042,"dvalue":10.147176352165722,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vma","value":209.12496702206641,"dvalue":7.284421380726837,"abstract":false,"competitive":false},{"slug":"marathon","value":285.2210502586636,"dvalue":14.043062350267725,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"half-marathon","value":259.41833721765465,"dvalue":12.311492333291852,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"10km","value":244.34780655450342,"dvalue":10.710852674721375,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"5km","value":231.14055103771972,"dvalue":9.370265667847029,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"1500m","value":209.87425550343158,"dvalue":7.351982430494332,"abstract":false,"competitive":true},{"slug":"endurance-confort","value":336.1937484237514,"dvalue":21.423432828566582,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"endurance-fondamentale","value":323.68671021080576,"dvalue":19.8431747524336,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"endurance-active","value":314.0914031737612,"dvalue":18.65417917487921,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"vo2max","value":209.12496702206641,"dvalue":7.284421380726837,"abstract":true,"competitive":false},{"slug":"race","value":285,"dvalue":14.043062350267725,"abstract":false,"competitive":true,"race":{"distance":42.195,"elevation":0,"goalId":"6a675372ba63bbdf0c9d5e48"}}],"sessions":[{"_t":"SmartSessionWithStats","sport":"road","name":"EF_35","description":"Footing à courir 100% en endurance fondamentale. Le but n'est pas de courir pile au milieu de la fourchette d'allure donnée, mais de faire au mieux en fonction de la forme du jour. Si tu mesures ton cardio, reste en-dessous des 75% de ta Fréquence Cardiaque Maximale, c'est la limite de l'endurance fondamentale.","displayName":"Endurance Fondamentale","coachAdvice":"L'envie d'accélérer sur les footings ? Elle est naturelle, on l'a tous car le footing c'est facile ! Mais il faut absolument te retenir de le faire si tu veux progresser ! Courir plus vite, c'est générer de la fatigue (même un peu) qui va t'empêcher d'être à 100% sur la séance d'intensité suivante... et donc minimiser les progrès de celle-ci ! (je me répète, mais c'est important !)","test":false,"importance":false,"trainingType":"EF","trainingCategory":"road_basic_endurance","exercisesBlocks":[{"repeat":1,"exercises":[{"_t":"SmartExercise","name":"EF_35","exerciseType":"running","pace":{"name":"EF","value":325,"kind":"range","zoneKind":"Z2","abstract":false,"slug":"ef"},"durations":[{"value":35,"timeUnit":"minutes"}],"manualLap":false}]}],"difficulty":1,"trainingIndex":0,"weekDa